    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Last night when lamps and lamps were lit up all over town I thought: My Sohan, too, must have lit lamps and a few among them must surely be for me!",
      "path": "audio/1965-20/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.7550789999999998,
      "end": 10.951450999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And then I began to see the lamps you had lit, and also those your love has kept lit always.",
      "path": "audio/1965-20/03.mp3",
      "start": 12.248821000000001,
      "end": 18.169977
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I shall stay here another day.",
      "path": "audio/1965-20/04.mp3",
      "start": 19.424035999999997,
      "end": 21.318345
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I have talked of you to everybody and they are eager to meet you.",
      "path": "audio/1965-20/05.mp3",
      "start": 22.862811999999998,
      "end": 26.98
    }
  ]
}
